hedWords": [], "value": "Hi HN,<p>Llmtee is a lightweight llm proxy. I built this project because I needed a simple way to log llm calls across my agents.<p>Existing options require running Postgres, ClickHouse and Redis, or have me use an SDK. llmtree is just a single binary. You point your provider base url to llmtee, it will pass the traffic through chunk by chunk and log the usage to an SQLite database (or optionally Postgres).<p>The container image is ~25 MB. Memory footprint is around ~40 MB and added latency is ~0.2 ms."}, "title": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "Show HN: Log every LLM call with tokens, cost, latency, and time to first token"}, "url": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "https://github.com/garritfra/llmtee"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_garritfra", "story_50451943", "show_hn", "front_page"], "author": "garritfra", "children": [50479773], "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:55:46Z", "created_at_i": 1794394546, "num_comments": 0, "objectID": "50451943", "points": 4, "story_id": 50451943, "story_text": "Hi HN,<p>Llmtee is a lightweight llm proxy. I built this project because I needed a simple way to log llm calls across my agents.<p>Existing options require running Postgres, ClickHouse and Redis, or have me use an SDK. llmtree is just a single binary. You point your provider base url to llmtee, it will pass the traffic through chunk by chunk and log the usage to an SQLite database (or optionally Postgres).<p>The container image is ~25 MB. Memory footprint is around ~40 MB and added latency is ~0.2 ms.", "title": "Show HN: Log every LLM call with tokens, cost, latency, and time to first token", "updated_at": "2026-11-13T18:55:52Z", "url": "https://github.com/garritfra/llmtee"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "dethmasque"}, "title": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "Ctrl+C, Ctrl+v, Ctrl+cve: Bypassing Android's Clipboard Read Security Measures"}, 